  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-global-context（全局提示词配置）",
      "text": "装上以后，对话视图里会多出一个「全局提示词配置」标签页。写进去的内容会加在每个会话系统提示词的最前面，保存后下一条消息就生效，不用重启。\n\n[English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add -w github:ZZJQ678/dsh-global-context\n```\n\n装完重启一次 DSH。\n\n正文默认存在 `$DSH_HOME/global-context.md`，标签页底部会显示实际路径，也可以用记事本直接改这个文件。清空保存就不再注入。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发声明",
      "text": "本插件全程由 deepseek-v4.1-flash 完成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-global-context",
      "text": "Adds a \"Global Prompt\" tab to the conversation view. Whatever you write there is prepended to every session's system prompt, and saving takes effect on the next message — no restart needed.\n\n[中文说明](README.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add -w github:ZZJQ678/dsh-global-context\n```\n\nRestart DSH once afterwards.\n\nThe text is stored at `$DSH_HOME/global-context.md` by default. The tab shows the real path, and you can edit that file in any text editor instead. Clearing the box and saving stops the injection."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development note",
      "text": "Built entirely with deepseek-v4.1-flash."
    },
